  "question": {
    "text": "The relative lowering of the vapour pressure of an aqueous solution containing a nonvolatile solute is 0.0125. The molality of the solution is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "0.70 m",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "0.50 m",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "0.80 m",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "0.40 m",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "As we know<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math> mole fraction of solute<br />The ratio <math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi></mi></math> is the relative lowering of vapour pressure, which is equal to 0.0125 here.<br />So <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0125</mn></math><br />The relation between the mole fraction and molality is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> (molecular weight of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math> )<br />or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0.0125</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> w<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.70 m</mn></math>"
  }
}